    "text": "1 days ago ABILENE – Junior Andrew Taylor hit a career-high two home runs and picked up career marks in hits (3) and RBI (4) to extend The University of Texas Rio Grande Valley (UTRGV) Vaqueros baseball team's win streak to a season-best five games as they defeated the Abilene Christian Wildcats (ACU) 13-7 Tuesday at Crutcher Scott Field at Bullock Brothers Ballpark. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
